= Build factory cells and recruit

Organisers go from works gate to works gate in Bavaria. New cells meet in back rooms after the shift. The dues book fills slowly, and so does the list of names the police would like to have.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="bavaria"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

