title: Lead a strike or an unemployed march
subtitle: Some organisation; the police take note. The Left gains. · dev: org +2×m, pressure +6, strikes +1, workers_kpd +1×m, kf_left_strength +1
view-if: x_bavaria_struggle = 1
choose-if: c_bavaria_struggle = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_bavaria_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_bavaria_cd <= 0 : Needs at least a thin organisation here. ?]
