new-page: true

= Lead a strike or an unemployed march

In Bavaria the party calls the workers out: a strike over the wage the inflation ate this week, a march of the unemployed to the town hall. The employers answer with lockouts and the police with batons, and the workers see who stood with them.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="bavaria"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

