new-page: true

= Build the united front with SPD and union workers

In Bavaria our cells go to the SPD and union branches with a concrete proposal, not a lecture: a joint meeting, a joint demand, a joint committee. Some branch secretaries refuse. Some of their members come anyway.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="bavaria"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

