= Form a unit of the Proletarian Hundreds

A new unit of the Proletarian Hundreds forms in Bavaria: workers from the same works, drilling at night with what weapons they have. Today they protect meetings. What they will be asked to do tomorrow is a question the party has not yet answered.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="bavaria"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_bavaria_control
title: Set up price control committees
subtitle: Builds organisation; housewives and the unemployed come to us. · dev: org +3×m, pressure +3, workers_kpd +1×m, unemployed_kpd +1×m
view-if: x_bavaria_control = 1
choose-if: c_bavaria_control = 1
