new-page: true

= Set up price control committees

Control committees of workers and housewives go to the markets of Bavaria, check prices and hoards, and post the names of the profiteers. The police call it vigilantism. The queues call it the first sensible thing anyone has done.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="bavaria"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

