= Move the work underground

In Bavaria the work moves out of sight: lists burned, meetings in allotment huts, a second set of officers ready for the day the first are arrested.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="bavaria"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

